WEBVTT

01:22.870 --> 01:25.250
<b>Isn't this that song your dad liked?</b>

01:27.500 --> 01:29.370
<b>It's a sappy song.</b>

01:29.410 --> 01:31.910
<b>You think so? I liked it.</b>

01:32.450 --> 01:34.950
<b>Cornelius. Gimme some tissues.</b>

01:36.620 --> 01:37.700
<b>Sure.</b>

01:38.080 --> 01:44.950
<b>MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM
THUNDERBOLT"</b>

01:45.660 --> 01:48.120
<b>Gathered here at
the space fortress A Baoa Qu</b>

01:48.160 --> 01:51.790
<b>are young, elite troops
who have performed amazing feats,</b>

01:51.830 --> 01:54.540
<b>as well the leading minds
of the Principality</b>

01:54.580 --> 01:56.870
<b>who were awarded
the glorious Zeon Science Medal.</b>

01:57.750 --> 02:00.870
<b>Their loyalty was praised
at the staff meeting</b>

02:00.910 --> 02:04.040
<b>of the prestigious
Zeon Space Strike Fleet!</b>

02:04.660 --> 02:06.250
<b>We members of the Zeon armed forces
must become the cornerstone</b>

02:06.290 --> 02:11.040
<b>of the realization of
Spacenoid ideals!</b>

02:21.500 --> 02:23.040
<b>There's no itching
in your mind, is there?</b>

02:23.080 --> 02:24.250
<b>It's fine.</b>

02:25.500 --> 02:26.410
<b>Okay, then.</b>

02:31.080 --> 02:32.950
<b>Beginning recording.</b>

02:36.790 --> 02:38.950
<b>We'll be starting
Phase 6 today.</b>

02:39.000 --> 02:40.200
<b>I heard.</b>

02:40.250 --> 02:41.830
<b>We need to run
checks first, right?</b>

02:41.870 --> 02:43.250
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

02:44.040 --> 02:46.160
<b>Neural transmission shows green.</b>

02:46.200 --> 02:49.450
<b>Step off with your right foot.
Now pull it back</b>

02:49.500 --> 02:50.450
<b>and then...</b>

02:50.500 --> 02:52.450
<b>Good! Now your left.</b>

02:52.500 --> 02:56.790
<b>Switch from right to left in time
with the speed on the bar.</b>

02:58.450 --> 02:59.370
<b>Okay!</b>

02:59.410 --> 03:00.330
<b>Professor!</b>

03:00.370 --> 03:02.250
<b>Begin Reuse Psycho Device</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:03.580
<b>operation test.</b>

03:04.700 --> 03:05.790
<b>Roger that.</b>

04:44.540 --> 04:45.870
<b>It's an amazing system.</b>

04:46.120 --> 04:49.000
<b>I bet it'll let us act as more than snipers.</b>

04:50.160 --> 04:53.580
<b>We have far better
artificial legs than those.</b>

04:54.410 --> 04:56.000
<b>I know.</b>

04:56.040 --> 04:57.580
<b>But that system will let me do more than</b>

04:57.620 --> 05:00.500
<b>I ever could with my real legs, right?</b>

05:00.540 --> 05:02.500
<b>You want another medal?</b>

05:02.540 --> 05:04.540
<b>You got one, too!</b>

05:05.160 --> 05:08.500
<b>I threw it away.
I hate war.</b>

05:35.410 --> 05:36.750
<b>Gundam!</b>

05:36.790 --> 05:39.080
<b>Let's see you blow my mind!</b>

05:44.200 --> 05:46.750
<b>Noise level nominal.
All green.</b>

05:46.790 --> 05:47.950
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:48.700 --> 05:50.120
<b>Chief Daryl</b>

05:50.160 --> 05:52.750
<b>you don't think this place is haunted, do you?</b>

05:52.790 --> 05:53.790
<b>Out in space?</b>

05:53.830 --> 05:56.580
<b>Lots of people died at Side 4,</b>

05:56.620 --> 05:59.370
<b>so I was wondering if sensitives see ghosts here.</b>

05:59.410 --> 06:01.410
<b>Horror movies freak me out,
so I just thought...</b>

06:01.450 --> 06:02.750
<b>Well, I don't see any.</b>

06:02.790 --> 06:04.750
<b>Oh, really? That's a relief...</b>

06:06.160 --> 06:08.290
<b>It's terrible,</b>

06:08.330 --> 06:09.870
<b>you having to go out in a Zaku I, Chief.</b>

06:09.910 --> 06:12.330
<b>Even if this is all we have left,</b>

06:12.370 --> 06:14.580
<b>our ace sniper deserves better
than some ancient Zaku I.</b>

06:14.620 --> 06:16.870
<b>A sniper doesn't need mobility.</b>

06:17.500 --> 06:20.620
<b>I'll just shoot any prey that gets
caught in our net, same as always.</b>

06:20.660 --> 06:21.950
<b>This is plenty.</b>

06:23.410 --> 06:27.450
<b>I figured you'd say that.
I hope you avenge our friends.</b>

06:27.500 --> 06:29.540
<b>Well, good hunting.</b>

06:29.580 --> 06:30.620
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:44.790 --> 06:47.000
<b>Fisher! Sean!
He's in your area!</b>

06:48.200 --> 06:49.290
<b>Gotcha!</b>

06:50.620 --> 06:51.870
<b>He's fast!
Try this, then!</b>

06:58.000 --> 06:59.120
<b>Over there, huh?</b>

07:03.660 --> 07:04.750
<b>Crap!</b>

07:11.500 --> 07:12.620
<b>You're mine!</b>

07:16.450 --> 07:17.540
<b>Damn it...</b>

07:21.500 --> 07:22.450
<b>Sean!</b>

07:24.290 --> 07:26.700
<b>Bunch of cowardly snakes!</b>

07:26.750 --> 07:32.000
<b>Can't you fight outside of your
hidey-holes in this debris?!</b>

07:32.040 --> 07:33.790
<b>Hit, damn it!</b>

07:36.950 --> 07:39.160
<b>That was too small!
Fisher, that blast...</b>

07:39.200 --> 07:41.160
<b>wasn't the Gundam!</b>

07:41.200 --> 07:44.950
<b>Where are you?
Where did you hide,</b>

07:49.950 --> 07:52.120
<b>That was also too small!
Was it another decoy?</b>

08:00.790 --> 08:03.410
<b>Move! Move, damn it!</b>

08:07.370 --> 08:08.620
<b>Now to finish you off!</b>

08:13.160 --> 08:14.290
<b>I see you!</b>

08:35.080 --> 08:36.830
<b>That's one hell of a long shot...</b>

08:36.870 --> 08:39.370
<b>Sniping me at this range</b>

08:39.410 --> 08:41.450
<b>means that it's you,</b>

08:41.500 --> 08:43.200
<b>isn't it, Peglegs?</b>

08:43.250 --> 08:45.790
<b>A thunderbolt deflected the beam?!</b>

08:45.830 --> 08:47.370
<b>I can't believe this guy's luck!</b>

08:47.410 --> 08:48.910
<b>Run, Daryl!</b>

08:48.950 --> 08:51.870
<b>When a sniper's location is given away, he's history!</b>

08:51.910 --> 08:54.330
<b>You're no match for a Gundam!</b>

08:54.370 --> 08:56.330
<b>Crap! I can't see a thing!</b>

09:00.790 --> 09:01.870
<b>Sean!</b>

09:01.910 --> 09:03.330
<b>He's still alive?!</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:06.580
<b>If you can predict my movements,
I dare you to fire!</b>

09:06.620 --> 09:09.120
<b>If you're prepared to kill
one of your own, that is!</b>

09:09.160 --> 09:11.660
<b>Shoot! Shoot this guy, Daryl!</b>

09:18.290 --> 09:20.370
<b>Trying to create a distraction
by adding to the debris, huh?</b>

09:20.410 --> 09:21.950
<b>I'll make a path for you. Come closer!</b>

09:22.000 --> 09:24.290
<b>I'll put a shot through just you!</b>

09:28.790 --> 09:30.910
<b>This song has me so pumped up!</b>

09:30.950 --> 09:32.660
<b>When you hear jazz like this,</b>

09:32.700 --> 09:33.950
<b>it's all over for you!</b>

09:38.450 --> 09:39.370
<b>- What the- -?</b>

09:39.410 --> 09:41.370
<b>- Light up!</b>

09:47.870 --> 09:49.080
<b>Sean!</b>

09:54.500 --> 09:55.580
<b>Above me?!</b>

10:06.160 --> 10:07.410
<b>With that body of yours,</b>

10:07.450 --> 10:09.540
<b>that must be the best you can do!</b>

10:09.580 --> 10:10.750
<b>Bastard!</b>

10:10.790 --> 10:13.080
<b>It's over, Peglegs!</b>

10:25.290 --> 10:26.700
<b>You son of a- -</b>

10:59.660 --> 11:02.000
<b>Focus attack on the center
of the enemy fleet!</b>

11:02.040 --> 11:03.450
<b>Maintain speed!</b>

11:03.500 --> 11:05.750
<b>Keep shooting until we're
out of firing range!</b>

11:10.500 --> 11:11.870
<b>- Two Musais destroyed!</b>

11:11.910 --> 11:13.700
<b>- Ten seconds to edge of firing range!</b>

11:20.000 --> 11:23.290
<b>We sank two Musais
with a single decoy Gundam.</b>

11:23.330 --> 11:25.790
<b>A fine plan, Captain.</b>

11:25.830 --> 11:27.290
<b>That's all we managed...?</b>

11:30.500 --> 11:32.660
<b>Running away again, huh?</b>

12:11.750 --> 12:14.250
<b>I'll dig up a new prosthetic hand for you.
Give me a minute.</b>

12:39.700 --> 12:41.450
<b>Two hours of stopgap repairs will let us</b>

12:41.500 --> 12:44.250
<b>send four mobile suits back into action.</b>

12:44.290 --> 12:46.870
<b>Only one Big Gun remains.</b>

12:47.700 --> 12:50.660
<b>Your team should be prepared
to die rather than surrender.</b>

12:50.700 --> 12:54.410
<b>The division has been ordered to defend
this sector to the death.</b>

12:54.450 --> 12:57.870
<b>If need be, the science team
is to die with us.</b>

13:01.660 --> 13:03.080
<b>Captain,</b>

13:03.120 --> 13:06.950
<b>our experiments have reached the stage
where it can be sent into the field.</b>

13:07.000 --> 13:09.410
<b>But that suit needs...</b>

13:09.450 --> 13:12.500
<b>If you mean the final key component,</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:14.540
<b>I'm sure you only need to give the word.</b>

13:26.950 --> 13:29.080
<b>You have to understand,
Prof. Karla!</b>

13:29.120 --> 13:30.120
<b>This is the only way</b>

13:30.160 --> 13:32.830
<b>to save the division from utter annihilation!</b>

13:32.870 --> 13:36.580
<b>Our experimental unit is the only thing
that can fight that Gundam!</b>

13:36.620 --> 13:38.120
<b>We can't, Sexton!</b>

13:38.160 --> 13:41.120
<b>It has to be hooked up to the nerves from four limbs to</b>

13:41.160 --> 13:42.790
<b>reach its full potential!</b>

13:42.830 --> 13:44.250
<b>We have Chief Petty Officer Daryl.</b>

13:44.290 --> 13:45.830
<b>What?</b>

13:45.870 --> 13:48.540
<b>He just lost his left hand
in battle, didn't he?</b>

13:48.580 --> 13:50.160
<b>What are you suggesting?</b>

13:51.160 --> 13:53.160
<b>Cut off his right hand!</b>

13:53.200 --> 13:54.950
<b>They aren't lab rats!</b>

13:55.000 --> 13:56.330
<b>This is hard for me, too!</b>

13:56.370 --> 14:00.830
<b>How much more of my soul are you
going to force me to give up?!</b>

14:04.370 --> 14:06.450
<b>If you don't help fight this war,</b>

14:06.500 --> 14:10.000
<b>what will happen to your father,
who's in prison for treason?</b>

14:12.370 --> 14:13.910
<b>Now is the time to put your brilliant</b>

14:13.950 --> 14:15.870
<b>research to work for the homeland!</b>

14:15.910 --> 14:18.500
<b>It's for the independence
of space emigrants!</b>

14:18.540 --> 14:20.410
<b>And for the Principality of Zeon!</b>

15:53.080 --> 15:57.330
<b>This is the real power of
the Reuse Psycho Device!</b>

15:57.370 --> 15:59.200
<b>I can crush the Gundam with this!</b>
